{"about_the_game":"The game is made based on the principle of Tic-Tac-Toe.<br>In order to win, the player needs three consecutive strongholds to form a line.<br>The game is made by UE4. Players can conduct game with computer or other players online.<br><br>[Gameplay]<br>In game,There are 9 strongholds in total.<br>Attacking the stronghold requires all guard AIs to be killed. Otherwise, the attack to stronghold is invalid. <br>Once the stronghold is occupied, the stronghold will be prompted on the UI interface in the upper right corner of the player.<br>When the stronghold UI shows that the strongholds occupied by a certain team of players is three consecutive strongholds in a line,determine the team's victory.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1254410?t=1619184271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1254410?t=1619184271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1619184271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1619184271","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"The game is made based on the principle of Tic-Tac-Toe.<br>In order to win, the player needs three consecutive strongholds to form a line.<br>The game is made by UE4. Players can conduct game with computer or other players online.<br><br>[Gameplay]<br>In game,There are 9 strongholds in total.<br>Attacking the stronghold requires all guard AIs to be killed. Otherwise, the attack to stronghold is invalid. <br>Once the stronghold is occupied, the stronghold will be prompted on the UI interface in the upper right